import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro"

const html =
  '<p>Koakademy replaces rigid, hardcoded enrollment rules with <strong>Enrollment Blueprints</strong>—a declarative, visual policy compiler that gives institutions complete flexibility over admission windows, academic eligibility, fee structures, and approval workflows.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>The Seven-Stage Guided Builder</h2>\n<pre><code>┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐\n│ 1. Scope │──▶│ 2. Window│──▶│3. Require│──▶│4. Billing│\n│ &amp; School │   │ &amp; Dates  │   │  &amp; Checks│   │ &amp; Tuition│\n└──────────┘   └──────────┘   └──────────┘   └────┬─────┘\n                                                  │\n               ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐        │\n               │7. Rollout│◀──│6. Verify │◀───────┘\n               │&amp; Activate│   │ &amp; Simulate│\n               └──────────┘   └──────────┘\n</code></pre>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Scope &amp; Inheritance:</strong> Target a policy globally, or inherit from a parent blueprint while applying sparse overrides to specific schools, degree programs, or student types (e.g., Freshmen, Transferees, Returnees).</li>\n<li><strong>Availability Windows:</strong> Define strict opening and closing dates and times for online enrollment portals, walk-in admissions, and late registration periods.</li>\n<li><strong>Eligibility &amp; Document Requirements:</strong> Specify mandatory academic requirements (e.g. minimum GWA, prerequisite completion) and required document uploads (PSA Birth Certificate, Form 137, Good Moral Certificate).</li>\n<li><strong>Subjects, Classes &amp; Tuition:</strong> Configure subject assignment models (Fixed Block Section vs. Free Subject Selection), per-unit lecture rates, laboratory fees, and institutional charges.</li>\n<li><strong>Approval Workflows:</strong> Construct safe acyclic review sequences involving Registrars, Department Deans, and Cashiers.</li>\n<li><strong>Journey Simulation:</strong> Run automated simulations against sample student profiles to verify that prerequisites, fee calculations, and approval gates resolve correctly.</li>\n<li><strong>Publication &amp; Activation:</strong> Publish an immutable, cryptographically hashed policy snapshot and activate it across targeted institutional scopes.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>Automated Eligibility &amp; Prerequisite Engine</h2>\n<p>During enrollment, Koakademy&#39;s rule engine evaluates every student journey against active policy criteria in real time:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Academic Standing Verification:</strong> Evaluates cumulative GWA against program retention policies. Students on academic probation are automatically redirected to academic advising before subject registration.</li>\n<li><strong>Automated Prerequisite Checks:</strong> Prevents subject selection if the required prerequisite course has not received a passing grade in the student&#39;s historical transcript.</li>\n<li><strong>Maximum Unit Overload Controls:</strong> Enforces maximum semester credit unit caps (e.g., 24 units maximum) unless an approved overload permit is recorded in the student&#39;s profile.</li>\n<li><strong>Clearance Gate Integration:</strong> Instantly flags active financial, library, or disciplinary holds, preventing final enrollment submission until all holds are cleared.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Dynamic Fee Calculation</h2>\n<p>The billing compiler calculates student assessments down to the centavo without manual staff intervention:</p>\n<pre><code class="language-txt">Total Assessment = (Lecture Units × Rate_lec) + (Lab Units × Rate_lab) + Assessed Fees - Discounts\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lecture vs. Laboratory Pricing:</strong> Distinct per-unit hourly rates for classroom lectures versus hands-on laboratory subjects.</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Discount Rules:</strong> Evaluates sibling discounts (e.g., 10% off tuition for second child), academic honor scholarships (e.g., 100% tuition waiver for Valedictorian), and athletic grants.</li>\n<li><strong>Installment Plan Schedules:</strong> Generates customized installment breakdowns (Downpayment, Prelims, Midterms, Prefinals, Finals) with clear due dates and minimum enrollment downpayment gates.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Acyclic Approval Timelines</h2>\n<p>Koakademy guarantees that enrollment workflows are strictly acyclic—preventing infinite approval loops or deadlock states:</p>\n<pre><code>┌─────────────────┐\n│ Student Submits │\n│  Registration   │\n└────────┬────────┘\n         │\n         ▼\n┌─────────────────┐     [Incomplete Docs]     ┌─────────────────┐\n│    Registrar    │ ────────────────────────▶ │ Returned with   │\n│   Evaluation    │                           │ Specific Note   │\n└────────┬────────┘                           └─────────────────┘\n         │ [Approved]\n         ▼\n┌─────────────────┐     [Overload Needed]     ┌─────────────────┐\n│ Department Dean │ ────────────────────────▶ │ Dean Review &amp;   │\n│  Subject Review │                           │ Overload Waiver │\n└────────┬────────┘                           └────────┬────────┘\n         │ [Approved]                                  │\n         ▼                                             │\n┌─────────────────┐ ◀──────────────────────────────────┘\n│ Cashier Payment │\n│   &amp; Validation  │\n└────────┬────────┘\n         │ [Paid / Cleared]\n         ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ Officially      │\n│ Enrolled State  │\n└─────────────────┘\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Conditional Branching:</strong> Steps activate only when relevant criteria are met (e.g., Dean approval is only triggered if the student requests a course overload or cross-enrollment).</li>\n<li><strong>Fallback Reviewers:</strong> If a primary reviewer is unavailable, requests automatically escalate to designated secondary roles after a configurable timeout.</li>\n<li><strong>Instant Student Feedback:</strong> Students receive live timeline progress updates in the Student Portal as each reviewer signs off.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Rollout States &amp; Snapshot Safety</h2>\n<p>To protect operational integrity during active semesters, Koakademy enforces an immutable versioning contract:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Policy Snapshots (<code>EnrollmentPolicySnapshot</code>):</strong> When a student completes enrollment, their assessment and subject line-up are pinned to a permanent snapshot.</li>\n<li><strong>Non-Destructive Adjustments:</strong> Adjusting tuition rates or curriculum rules mid-semester generates a new policy version for future terms without mutating existing enrolled students&#39; historical financial obligations.</li>\n<li><strong>One-Click Rollback:</strong> In the event of an erroneous policy release, administrators can instantly revert to a previous verified version without data loss.</li>\n</ul>\n'
---

